Phase 1: Session Creation
1. App.tsx (aria) mounts → immediately calls POST /sessions with X-User-Email header
2. Backend session_manager.py creates a VoiceLiveSession object
3. VoiceLiveSession.__init__():
- Checks if the email matches a predefined profile (profiles.py)
- If yes → builds a KNOWN USER CONTEXT block (skips identity questions)
