8. Deterministic Allocation Engine
This is the core innovation — the LLM doesn't invent percentages. Instead:
1. 3 anchor portfolios (from real US return/vol data in asset_stats.json):
- Conservative: 18% Large Cap, 4% Small Cap, 6% REITs, 10% Gold, 32% Bond, 15% Treasury, 15% Cash
- Moderate: 38/12/8/8/22/8/4
- Aggressive: 50/22/10/6/8/4/0
2. Aria's 5 risk bands are interpolations of these 3 anchors
3. Pipeline: base → goal tilt → horizon glide → floor → normalize → rollup to 3 classes → Commodities clamp ~10% → normalize to 100
4. Feasibility: Multi-goal assessment checks if ONE monthly contribution can fund ALL goals at once
