test_gold_tilt_raises_commodities	"More gold" raises Commodities above 10%
test_horizon_glide	Short horizon de-risks vs long horizon
test_blended_return_present	Blended return is sane (0-15%)
test_future_value_handcalc	FV matches hand-calculated values
test_required_return_and_monthly	Required return/monthly round-trips correctly
test_verdicts	On-track / stretch / unrealistic verdicts fire correctly
test_multi_goal_feasibility	Near-term unfundable goal isn't masked by fundable long-term one
Run with: python test_allocation_engine.py
Layer 3: Persona Test Suite (persona_test.py)
20 simulated personas + 3 predefined profiles = 23 full conversation tests. Each persona is GPT-4o role-playing a specific person with detailed financial facts. The test:
1. Opens a real WebSocket session with the backend
2. Persona replies to Aria's questions via /api/chat
3. Every tool call (recordAnswers, computeAndSaveProfile, computeAllocation, savePortfolio) is logged
4. Full transcript saved to test_transcripts/{persona}.md
5. After save, fetches per-class instruments via /api/me/composition
Personas cover edge cases:
